OL,3,GNEWSAWoman, 86, had agonising 30-hour
OL,4,Await in A&E, family says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of an 86-year-old
OL,7,Fgrandmother said her "agonising" wait
OL,8,Fin an emergency department rated by
OL,9,Finspectors as one of the worst in
OL,10,FEngland was an "absolute disgrace".
OL,12,FJoan Jones was left "rolling over in
OL,13,Fpain" at the A&E department at Royal
OL,14,FAlbert Edward Infirmary in Wigan,
OL,15,FGreater Manchester, her family said.
OL,17,FHer son, Barry Jones, said his mother
OL,18,Fhad suffered a collapsed gallbladder
OL,19,Fand was in "constant pain" while
OL,20,Fwaiting for treatment. He said it took
OL,21,F30 hours before she was admitted to a
OL,22,Fward.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
