OL,3,GNEWSAWoman, 86, had agonising 30-hour
OL,4,Await in A&E, family says
OL,5,
OL,6,FWrightington, Wigan and Leigh Teaching
OL,7,FHospitals NHS Foundation Trust said it
OL,8,Ftook the family's concerns "very
OL,9,Fseriously" and insisted cutting waiting
OL,10,Ftimes was a "key priority".
